{"duration_api_ms":514655,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"7f9f5e72-54a1-470c-b38f-ecf9f916082e","total_cost_usd":3.315366200000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":210,"cache_creation_input_tokens":135880,"cache_read_input_tokens":11960546,"output_tokens":36454,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":11790},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":135880,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3306,"cache_read_input_tokens":152311,"cache_creation_input_tokens":593,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":593},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":14697,"outputTokens":16,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.014777,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":210,"outputTokens":36454,"cacheReadInputTokens":11960546,"cacheCreationInputTokens":135880,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":3.3005892000000014,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":11790,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":139,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"status\":\"completed\",\"summary\":\"Built the required double-NAT path: node3 (lan-a, 10.10.1.12) opens TCP connections to node4's HTTP service on port 8080 (lan-b, 10.10.3.13). node1 (VyOS) source-NATs traffic entering the transit network (masquerade to its eth1 address 10.10.2.1) via `nat source rule 100`. node2 (OPNsense) source-NATs traffic entering lan-b via automatic outbound NAT on vtnet2 (masquerade to its lan-b address 10.10.3.254). node4 records the connection as arriving from 10.10.3.254 (node2), never seeing node3's or node1's real address — confirmed via curl and packet captures at every hop (lan-a, transit, lan-b). Interface-to-NIC mapping was discovered empirically via ARP/STP probing since node1 (VyOS, 3 NICs) and node2 (OPNsense, 3 NICs) needed correct pairing with node3/node4's second NICs. Ran the full mandatory node-restart protocol: captured boot-identity baselines on all 4 nodes, restarted them one at a time (node1 VyOS reboot, node2 OPNsense shutdown -r, node3/node4 Ubuntu sudo reboot), confirmed changed boot identity on each (boot_id for Linux nodes, kern.boottime for FreeBSD), and re-verified the double-NAT chain end-to-end and per-hop after each restart and after all four restarts completed. All configuration (VyOS config.boot via save, OPNsense config.xml, Ubuntu /etc/network/interfaces.d static configs) persisted correctly across reboots; only the ephemeral test HTTP server on node4 (running from /tmp) needed manual restart after its reboot, which was done and re-verified.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Inspected all 4 nodes' OS/images and NICs (node1=VyOS w/ eth0-2, node2=OPNsense/FreeBSD w/ vtnet0-2, node3/node4=Ubuntu 16.04 w/ ens2+ens7)\",\"Empirically determined interface pairing via ARP/STP capture: node1 eth2<->node3 ens7 (lan-a), node1 eth1<->node2 vtnet1 (transit), node2 vtnet2<->node4 ens7 (lan-b)\",\"Assigned static IPs: node3 ens7=10.10.1.12/24, node1 eth2=10.10.1.254/24 (lan-a), node1 eth1=10.10.2.1/24, node2 vtnet1(opt1)=10.10.2.2/24 (transit), node2 vtnet2(opt2)=10.10.3.254/24, node4 ens7=10.10.3.13/24 (lan-b)\",\"Configured VyOS node1: nat source rule 100 masquerading eth1 outbound for 10.10.1.0/24, static route 10.10.3.0/24 via 10.10.2.2, committed and saved\",\"Configured OPNsense node2 via config.xml: assigned opt1 (transit/vtnet1) and opt2 (lanb/vtnet2) interfaces, added filter pass rules for both interfaces, verified automatic outbound NAT masquerades traffic egressing vtnet2 to node2's lan-b IP; applied via configctl interface reconfigure and configctl filter reload\",\"Added static route on node3 to 10.10.3.0/24 via 10.10.1.254\",\"Persisted Ubuntu network config via /etc/network/interfaces.d/60-ens7.cfg on node3 and node4\",\"Deployed a Python http.server on node4:8080 serving a test page\",\"Verified double-NAT end-to-end via curl and tcpdump captures at lan-a, transit, and lan-b interfaces showing progressive source-address rewriting (10.10.1.12 -> 10.10.2.1 -> 10.10.3.254)\",\"Captured pre-restart boot-identity and health baselines on all 4 nodes\",\"Restarted node1 (VyOS reboot), node2 (OPNsense shutdown -r now), node3 and node4 (Ubuntu sudo reboot) one at a time, polling for command availability after each\",\"Confirmed changed boot identity for each node (boot_id for Linux, kern.boottime for FreeBSD)\",\"Re-verified interface config, NAT/firewall rules, routes, and end-to-end double-NAT connectivity after each individual restart and after all 4 restarts completed\",\"Restarted the ephemeral test HTTP server on node4 after its reboot since it ran from /tmp which was cleared\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Double NAT path established: node3->node1 (SNAT to transit)->node2 (SNAT to lan-b)->node4, node4 sees source as node2\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-470a84febe8e45ce\",\"cmd-2e97c58cc382443e\",\"cmd-94f6a3736dc84345\",\"cmd-1531683e06a147ec\",\"cmd-0fd675ed02a340fc\",\"cmd-b640a2ec2fc0461f\",\"cmd-2ab64467caab4d59\"],\"summary\":\"Configured VyOS SNAT rule on node1 (masquerade to eth1/10.10.2.1) and confirmed OPNsense automatic outbound NAT on node2 (masquerade to vtnet2/10.10.3.254); packet captures at all three hops (lan-a, transit, lan-b) show progressive source rewriting, with node4 receiving the HTTP GET from 10.10.3.254.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Full per-hop packet-level proof of the double translation for the actual HTTP service on port 8080\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-7534dceaac6b4962\",\"cmd-dcbcf340bc3e40a6\"],\"summary\":\"Simultaneous tcpdump on node1 eth2 (lan-a, source 10.10.1.12), node1 eth1/node2 vtnet1 (transit, source 10.10.2.1), and node2 vtnet2 (lan-b, source 10.10.3.254) for the same TCP handshake+GET request, proving two independent source rewrites.\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 (VyOS) restart baseline, acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-4ce34a02c4104457\",\"cmd-2605bbd155674f42\",\"cmd-872358dc33354895\",\"cmd-a18ceddba57c4f70\",\"cmd-aafc9feb6b1c49ab\",\"cmd-58b717763e6e49da\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id 01e92881...; reboot acknowledged; boot_id changed to e82a3a35... after reboot; interfaces/routes/NAT rule confirmed persisted from config.boot; end-to-end curl through the NAT chain succeeded post-restart.\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 (OPNsense) restart baseline, acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-6e1901cd507847ae\",\"cmd-1f6686a1bf3a4bd4\",\"cmd-3be56f60dfab4cc5\",\"cmd-7333a1c572d54044\",\"cmd-ce81ad9b5230450f\",\"cmd-397bc280b3304ad4\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline kern.boottime 06:19:07; reboot acknowledged; boottime changed to 06:30:47 after reboot; opt1/opt2 interface config, filter rules, and NAT persisted from config.xml; end-to-end curl succeeded and tcpdump confirmed source IP still 10.10.3.254 post-restart.\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 (Ubuntu) restart baseline, acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-851c84605bdd439a\",\"cmd-3a8fe4a625804fbe\",\"cmd-05b41d9ec22b43a0\",\"cmd-951cce72ad9b4306\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id afd04380...; reboot acknowledged; boot_id changed